---
import ArrowRight from "@lucide/astro/icons/arrow-right";
---

<section
  id="services"
  class="bg-cream px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28"
  aria-labelledby="services-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="mb-14 flex flex-col gap-6 md:mb-20 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <p class="mb-4 text-xs tracking-[0.36em] text-sage-deep uppercase">Практики</p>
        <h2 id="services-heading" class="font-serif text-4xl tracking-wide text-forest sm:text-5xl">
          Ритуалы тела
        </h2>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/services"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm tracking-[0.16em] text-taupe-muted uppercase transition-all duration-300 hover:text-forest"
      >
        Полный прайс
        <ArrowRight size={16} class="transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" />
      </a>
    </div>

    <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-5">
      <li class="md:col-span-4 md:min-h-[18rem]">
        <a
          href="/services#classic"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-sage/25 bg-sage/15 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-sage/60 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(138,154,134,0.18)] sm:p-8"
        >
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-sage/25">
            <div class="h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-sage/40 to-forest/20 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl tracking-wide text-forest">Классический массаж</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-light text-taupe-muted">
              Базовая практика для тех, кто хочет тишины в мышцах после долгой недели.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-sage-deep uppercase">
              К карточке
              <ArrowRight size={14} class="transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" />
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>

      <li class="md:col-span-8 md:min-h-[22rem]">
        <a
          href="/services#stone"
          class="group flex h-full flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-sand bg-sand/70 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-sage/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_48px_rgba(138,154,134,0.22)] sm:p-10 md:flex-row md:items-end"
        >
          <div class="md:max-w-md">
            <p class="mb-4 text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.28em] text-taupe-muted uppercase">Акцент сезона</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl tracking-wide text-forest sm:text-4xl">Стоун-терапия</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-taupe-muted sm:text-base">
              Укрупнённый ритуал тепла: камни держат температуру, руки мастера — ритм. Для глубокого отпускания.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl md:mt-0 md:w-2/5">
            <div class="h-40 bg-gradient-to-tr from-taupe/30 via-sage/30 to-cream transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 md:h-48"></div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>

      <li class="md:col-span-8">
        <a
          href="/services#rituals"
          class="group flex h-full min-h-[16rem] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-taupe/10 bg-cream p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-sage/40 hover:bg-sand/40 sm:p-8 md:flex-row md:items-center"
        >
          <div class="md:max-w-lg">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl tracking-wide text-forest sm:text-3xl">SPA-ритуалы</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-light text-taupe-muted">
              Широкая карта: пар, масла, паузы. Авторские церемонии на 90 и 120 минут.
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-sage-deep uppercase md:mt-0">
            Смотреть ритуалы
            <ArrowRight size={14} class="transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" />
          </span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <li class="md:col-span-4">
        <a
          href="/services#lifting"
          class="group flex h-full min-h-[16rem] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-sage/20 bg-sage-deep/10 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-sage/15 sm:p-8"
        >
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
            <div class="h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream to-sage/40 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-5">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl tracking-wide text-forest">Лифтинг-массаж</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-light text-taupe-muted">
              Скульптура лица руками. Мягкий тонус без аппаратов.
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
